==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Silver Tempest|Ferroseed|121}} from the {{TCG|Silver Tempest}} expansion; both cards have the Rolling Tackle attack.
*'''Rolling Tackle''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Dark Electrode|34}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

